  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Majestic Pose</em></p>\n<p>You have learned to activate your technique in a fraction of a second. </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>When you use <em>Golden Hour</em>, you can instead use it as a free action on your turn instead of as a bonus action.   </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>As a reaction for 5 CE, you can stop time for yourself and immediately take one turn. After time resumes, your movement is 0 ft and you cannot take actions until the end of your next turn.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>At 6th level, you can use <em>Golden Week</em> as a bonus action instead of an action.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
